#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxsizetab.cpp:91
msgid ""
"You must load a K3b DVD Project file and \n"
" set a file name for the final AVI."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​ត្រូវ​តែ​ផ្ទុក​ឯកសារ​គម្រោង​ឌីវីឌី​របស់ K3b\n"
"ហើយ​កំណត់​ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​មួយ​សម្រាប់ AVI ចុងក្រោយ ។"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:39
msgid "Wrong setting"
msgstr "ខុស​ការ​កំណត់​"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:40
msgid ""
"The deinterlace filter YUVDeinterlaceMMX doesn't work with RGB mode. You "
"must enable using YUV colorspace."
msgstr ""

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:42
msgid ""
"The deinterlace filter SmartDeinterlace doesn't work with YUV colorspace. It "
"only works with RGB. You must disable using YUV colorspace."
msgstr ""

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:52
msgid "Extended Audio/Video Settings"
msgstr "ការ​កំណត់​អូឌីយ៉ូ/វីដេអូ ដែល​ពង្រីក"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:58
msgid "Keyframes:"
msgstr ""

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:59
msgid ""
"Keyframes (same as I-frames) are \"full\" pictures of an MPEG-stream. They "
"are similar to a simple JPEG and have the best quality in a video. All "
"pictures following are only stored as differences to a keyframe. Here you "
"can set the maximum distance between two keyframes. In most cases this will "
"rarely be used, as the codec will automatically insert a keyframe on each "
"scene change. Default is 300."
msgstr ""

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:66
msgid "Crispness:"
msgstr "ភាព​ស្រួយ ៖"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:67
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can smooth the video during the encoding process. It is better to "
"leave crispness at 100% for encoding and smooth the video during playback "
"instead."
msgstr "នៅ​ទីនេះ អ្នក​អាច​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​វីដេអូ​រលូន កំឡុង​ពេល​អ៊ិនកូដ ។ យក​ល្អ​អ្នក​គួរ​តែ​ទុក​ការ​ច្រឹប​នៅ​ត្រឹម ១០០% ដើម្បី​អ៊ិនកូដ ហើយ​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​វីដេអូ​រលូន នៅ​ពេល​ចាក់​វិញ ។"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:72
msgid "Audio language:"
msgstr "ភាសា​អូឌីយ៉ូ ៖"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:73
msgid ""
"Select the language and the surround mode. Typically there are \"MPEG2 "
"Stereo\", \"AC3 2ch and 6ch\" and \"DTS 6ch\". You can probably choose AC3 "
"6ch, AC3 2ch and MPEG2 Stereo in descending order, depending on your "
"language (It doesn't matter if DTS works or not, you can still try it)."
msgstr ""

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:79
msgid "Deinterlace mode:"
msgstr "របៀប​ត្របាញ់ ៖"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Select a deinterlace mode if you have interlaced "
"material.<ul><li><strong>Fast</strong> is the standard deinterlace "
"mode</li><li><strong>Encoder Based</strong> uses the internal deinterlace of "
"the codec (be aware that some codecs may have no "
"deinterlacer)</li><li><strong>Zoom to Full Frame</strong> no matter how it "
"works but it is rather good and slow. Use this if <strong>Fast</strong> "
"still produces interlace stripes or color artifacts (red shadow, "
"etc.)<li><li><strong>Drop Field/Half Height</strong> uses only one field and "
"scales it.</li><li><strong>SmartDeinterlace</strong> provides a smart, "
"motion-based deinterlacing capability. Ported from VirtualDub by Tilmann "
"Bitterberg. Operates in RGB space only. Tilmann did some testing of "
"deinterlace filters available in transcode. You can view and read the result "
"on tibit.org/video/. </li><li><strong>YUVDeinterlaceMMX</strong> is a "
"deinterlace for YUV mode by Thomas Oestreich.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:111
msgid "Resample to 44.1 kHz"
msgstr ""

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:112
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the audio track will be downsampled from 48 kHz to 44.1 "
"kHz. Useful because some soundcards have problems with a sampling rate of 48 "
"kHz."
msgstr ""

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:115
msgid "Use YUV colorspace."
msgstr "ប្រើពណ៌ YUV ។"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:116
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the internal codec works with the YUV colorspace instead "
"of using RGB. Useful because DVD also has YUV colorspace and it is twice "
"fast as RGB. You only need RGB colorspace if a filter needs it (filters not "
"yet supported)."
msgstr "បើ​ជ្រើស​ជម្រើស​នេះ កូដិក​ខាង​ក្នុង​នឹង​ដំណើរការ​ជាមួយ​ពណ៌ YUV ជំនួស​ឲ្យ RGB ។ វា​ក៏​មាន​ប្រយោជន៍​ណាស់​ដែរ ព្រោះ​ឌីវីឌី​ក៏​ប្រើ​ពណ៌ YUV ដែរ ហើយ​វា​មាន​ល្បឿន​លឿន​ជាង RGB ដល់​ទៅ​ទ្វេដង​ឯណោះ ។ អ្នក​ត្រូវ​ប្រើ​ពណ៌ RGB តែ​នៅ​ពេល​ដែល​តម្រង​ត្រូវការ​ប៉ុណ្ណោះ (មិន​ទាន់​គាំទ្រ​តម្រង​នៅ​ឡើយ​ទេ) ។"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:121
msgid "0 - None"
msgstr "0 - គ្មាន"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:122
msgid "1 - Fast"
msgstr "1 - លឿន​"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:123
msgid "2 - Encoder Based"
msgstr "2 - ផ្អែក​លើ​អ៊ិនកូឌ័រ"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:124
msgid "3 - Zoom to Full Frame"
msgstr "3 - ពង្រីក​ឲ្យ​ពេញ​ស៊ុម"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:125
msgid "4 - Drop Field/Half Height"
msgstr ""

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:126
msgid "Filter - SmartDeinterlace"
msgstr "តម្រង - SmartDeinterlace"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:127
msgid "Filter - YUVDeinterlaceMMX"
msgstr "តម្រង - YUVDeinterlaceMMX"

